@startuml
start
note left: Operational Mode 'onedrive -s --resync'
:Discard previous local sync database state;
:Query OneDrive and rebuild authoritative online state;
if (Online item is a file and same pathname exists locally?) then (yes)
  note left: There is no prior DB baseline after --resync
  :Compare local content hash with online content hash;
  if (Hashes match?) then (yes)
    :Reconcile metadata and rebuild DB record;
    note left: --resync by itself does NOT create a safeBackup
  else (no)
    :Download online replacement to <canonical>.partial;
    :Validate HTTP result, size and file hash;
    :Create and verify safeBackup copy of local file;
    note left: Canonical pathname remains present\nuntil validated replacement commit
    :Recheck canonical did not change;
    :Atomically promote validated .partial to canonical pathname;
  endif
else (no)
  :Download/create online item as required;
endif
:Perform database consistency and integrity check;
:Scan local filesystem for new data to upload;
note left: A created safeBackup may be uploaded here\nunless excluded by skip_file
stop
@enduml
